  "title": "Spiced Butternut Squash Muffins",
  "description": "Here's another fantastic way to use up some of the squash harvest! These wonderful muffins are filled with flavor!",
  "authors": [
    "Lindsay Ho"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:07:22-04:00",
